{"item_id": "BM1427", "position": 544, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_24", "anon_id": "M-24-004", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "bt <- binom.test(2, 10, 0.5)\npv <- bt$p.value\nci <- bt$conf.int\ncontains <- ci[1] <= 0.5 && ci[2] >= 0.5\nvalue <- pv\nanswer <- if (pv > 0.05 && contains) \"C\" else if (pv < 0.05) \"A\" else \"D\"", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": ["C"], "note": "Reruns binom.test, then checks the p-value against 0.05 and whether the CI contains 0.5."}
{"item_id": "BM0545", "position": 545, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_24", "anon_id": "M-24-005", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "n1 <- 10; s1 <- 4; n2 <- 15; s2 <- 6\nv1 <- s1^2/n1; v2 <- s2^2/n2\nanswer <- (v1 + v2)^2 / (v1^2/(n1-1) + v2^2/(n2-1))", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": [], "note": "Applies the Welch-Satterthwaite formula."}
{"item_id": "BM0546", "position": 546, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_24", "anon_id": "M-24-006", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "not_applicable", "r_code": "", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": ["D"], "note": "Conceptual: Var(R+M) = Var(R) + Var(M) + 2Cov(R,M), and the covariance is positive here."}
